    "macOS may be hiding it, or the menu bar is too full to show it. You can still open Overbright from Finder or Spotlight." : {
      "comment" : "Menu bar icon window: text when the on/off shortcut is cleared",
      "localizations" : {
        "ar" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "macOS may be hiding it, or the menu bar is too full to show it. You can still open Overbright from Finder or Spotlight."
          }
        },
        "ca" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Pot ser que el macOS l’amagui o que la barra de menús sigui massa plena per mostrar‑la. Encara pots obrir l’Overbright des del Finder o l’Spotlight."
          }
        },
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Možná ji skrývá macOS nebo je řádek nabídek příliš zaplněný. Overbright můžete i nadále otevřít z Finderu nebo pomocí Spotlightu."
          }
        },
        "da" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "macOS skjuler det måske, eller også er der ikke plads til det på menulinjen. Du kan stadig åbne Overbright fra Finder eller Spotlight."
          }
        },
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "macOS blendet es möglicherweise aus, oder die Menüleiste ist zu voll. Du kannst Overbright weiterhin über den Finder oder Spotlight öffnen."
          }
        },
        "el" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "macOS may be hiding it, or the menu bar is too full to show it. You can still open Overbright from Finder or Spotlight."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Puede que macOS lo esté ocultando o que la barra de menús esté demasiado llena para mostrarlo. Aun así, puedes abrir Overbright desde el Finder o Spotlight."
          }
        },
        "fi" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "macOS may be hiding it, or the menu bar is too full to show it. You can still open Overbright from Finder or Spotlight."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "macOS la masque peut-être, ou la barre des menus est trop pleine pour l’afficher. Vous pouvez toujours ouvrir Overbright depuis le Finder ou Spotlight."
          }
        },
        "he" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "macOS may be hiding it, or the menu bar is too full to show it. You can still open Overbright from Finder or Spotlight."
          }
        },
        "hi" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "macOS may be hiding it, or the menu bar is too full to show it. You can still open Overbright from Finder or Spotlight."
          }
        },
        "hr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "macOS je možda skriva ili je traka s izbornicima prepuna da bi je prikazala. Overbright i dalje možete otvoriti iz Findera ili Spotlighta."
          }
        },
        "hu" : {
